 "verdicts": {
  "A merge queue cannot resolve genuine textual conflicts; pnpm-lock.yaml was identified as the main contention hotspot for parallel agents.": 1,
  "With 'require branches to be up to date' enabled, parallel agent PRs from the same commit must each be resynced and have CI rerun sequentially even when they don't conflict; a project with 2–3 minute CI found this serialisation the dominant cost, and the GitHub merge queue's speculative validation and batching removes it.": 1
 }
